
appearance-title = Translation appearance
appearance-font-size-label = Font size
appearance-font-size-help = 10–32 px. Applies to the translation block; saved changes apply to open readers immediately.
appearance-color-label = Text color
appearance-color-help = Pick a color with the swatch, type a hex value, or choose a preset. "Follow theme" uses Zotero's current text color; Reset returns to the default.
appearance-color-inherit-label = Follow theme
appearance-color-inherit-help = Uses Zotero's current theme color. The swatch, hex field and presets are disabled while this is on.
appearance-font-family-label = Font family
appearance-font-family-help = Enter CSS font names or click a preset on the right. Leave empty to inherit the reader font.
appearance-font-preset-title = Font presets
appearance-font-preset-inherit = Inherit
appearance-font-preset-georgia = Georgia
appearance-font-preset-times = Times
appearance-font-preset-arial = Arial
appearance-font-preset-yahei = YaHei
appearance-font-preset-simsun = SimSun
appearance-line-height-label = Line height
appearance-line-height-help = Between 1 and 2.5. The default is 1.75.
appearance-paragraph-spacing-label = Paragraph spacing (em)
appearance-paragraph-spacing-help = 0–3 em below each translation block. The default is 1.25.
appearance-background-label = Background
appearance-background-help = Pick a background with the swatch, type a hex value, or choose a preset. "Transparent" leaves it unset; Reset returns to the default.
appearance-background-inherit-label = Transparent
appearance-background-inherit-help = Keeps the background transparent so the reader page shows through.
appearance-theme-label = Theme
appearance-theme-auto = Follow Zotero
appearance-theme-light = Light
appearance-theme-dark = Dark
appearance-theme-help = Sets the translation block colors. Text color and background above override the theme.
appearance-underline-label = Underline translation
appearance-underline-color-label = Underline color
appearance-underline-color-help = Pick an underline color with the swatch, hex field or a preset. "Match text color" follows the text; Reset returns to the default.
appearance-underline-color-inherit-label = Match text color
appearance-underline-color-inherit-help = Matches the text color set above.
appearance-ribbon-label = Show left ribbon
appearance-ribbon-color-label = Ribbon color
appearance-ribbon-color-help = The ribbon marks each translation block. Pick a color with the swatch, hex field or a preset; Reset returns to the default blue.
appearance-color-reset = Reset to default
appearance-color-hex-label = Hex color value
appearance-color-hex-invalid = Invalid color. Enter #RGB or #RRGGBB.
appearance-color-preview-inherit = Inherited / transparent
